[{"id": 120882971, "text": "761891943", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 2, "btnType": "PRIMARY", "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "VIDEO", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{'headers':['Col1'],'rows':[{'col1':'row1'},{'col1':'row2'}, {'col1':'row3'}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 2876, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": false, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 3982, "text": "Ask your child to read their book to you. When they are reading, listen out for when they make mistakes. Use the ideas below to help them practise correcting their mistakes.\n", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 1, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": null, "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": null, "timerData": null, "activityId": 2876, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": null, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": null, "textCarouselData": null, "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}, {"id": 40918482, "text": "<ol>\n<b><li> Encourage them to read the sentence again. </b> <dd>See if they correct the mistake. If not, carry on from step 2.</dd></li>\n<b><li> Repeat the sentence to your child.</b> <dd> Say it exactly as they read it. </dd></li>\n<b><li> Ask them if it that sounds right. </b><dd> They should be able to spot the word they got wrong.</dd></li>\n<b><li> Ask them to re-read the sentence. </b><dd> Check it makes sense now.</dd> </li>\n</ol>\n<br>After lots of practice, children should be able to go back and correct themselves on their own while they are reading!", "modal": {"steps": [null], "details": null}, "order": 3, "btnType": null, "linkUrl": null, "audioUrl": null, "fileName": null, "fontSize": null, "fontType": "SassoonInfantRg-Regular", "imageUrl": null, "linkName": null, "stepType": "TEXT_AND_IMAGE", "tabsData": null, "deletedAt": null, "tableData": "{\"headers\":[\"Col1\"],\"rows\":[{\"col1\":\"row1\"},{\"col1\":\"row2\"}, {\"col1\":\"row3\"}]}", "timerData": null, "activityId": 2876, "dimensions": null, "editAsHtml": false, "properties": {"height": "", "fontArray": [[]], "inputArray": [[]], "widthArray": [[""]]}, "deletedById": null, "downloadUrl": null, "editorState": null, "carouselData": null, "downloadName": null, "accordionData": null, "includeSeconds": null, "selectedModalId": 0, "textCarouselData": "{ \"text\": [] }", "checkListTextData": null, "imageCarouselData": null, "checklistImageData": null, "clickableAlphabetData": null}]